_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-24T00:16:54Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T10:10:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible on 4.6.1, 4.6, 4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 24.04, Windows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you use the Unwrap UV2 for Lightmap/AO function on an ArrayMesh, it clears the resource path. Next time it is saved, it will be embedded in the scene. This means large meshes saved as individual files will get silently pulled into the scene file.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMake a MeshInstance3D with an ArrayMesh (fastest way is to create a CSGBox3D and bake it)\nSave it to a `.tres` or `.res` file.\nUse the 'Unwrap UV2 for Lightmap/AO' tool\nObserve the resource path is cleared\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A, trivial to reproduce from blank project.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116695/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}